d 'MISPAUTO': module supporting discrimination between autocorrelation and misspecification
d
d  A significant Durbin-Watson statistic is consistent with at
d least four different states of the world -- no problem, AR(1)
d disturbances, non-AR(1) autocorrelation, or misspecification of
d the regression function -- and the appropriate responses are
d mutually incompatible. 
d
d KW: autocorrelation
d KW: misspecification
d KW: time series
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261010
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f mispauto.ado
f mispauto.sthlp
f mispauto_ghutton.sthlp
f mispauto_godfrey.sthlp
f mispauto_knottnerus.sthlp
f mispauto_methods.sthlp
f mispauto_postestimation.sthlp
f mispauto_thursby.sthlp
f mispauto_demo.do
f mispauto_example.do
